== Notes ==
* Mantles do not absorb all spells, just the ones that check [[spell resistance]].
* This spell replaces earlier castings of itself, and it also displaces earlier castings of ''lesser spell mantle'' and ''greater spell mantle''.
*The [[empower spell|empowered]] version of ''[[lesser spell mantle]]'' also occupies a level 7 [[spell slot]] and absorbs 10-15 spell levels before collapsing (similar to the 9-16 absorbed by this spell). Mages with the empower spell feat &mdash; particularly [[sorcerer]]s, who have a limited spell selection &mdash; may want to use ''lesser spell mantle'' (empowered) instead of this spell, at least until ''spell mantle'' can be empowered.
*The empowered version of this spell occupies a level 9 spell slot and absorbs 13-24 spell levels before collapsing, which is more than what is absorbed by ''[[greater spell mantle]]''. Mages with the empower spell feat &mdash; particularly sorcerers, who have a limited spell selection &mdash; may want to use this spell (empowered) instead of ''greater spell mantle''.
* Due to a .2da bug, neither ''lesser spell mantle'' nor ''greater spell mantle'' is an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

